---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
	<Header />
	<main>
		<h1>About</h1>

		<p>
			I didn't start out chasing uptime. I started as a Django developer, building backend
			services and shipping features. My path into SRE and platform engineering was almost
			accidental: at one job, we had several Django developers and no dedicated DevOps
			engineer. The one we had left, and while management searched for a replacement, I
			picked up CI/CD and deployments myself. Somewhere in that stretch, I realized I cared
			more about whether the service stayed up than about the next feature: the mechanics of
			high availability, and the discipline of security, over feature velocity. That's what
			pulled me fully into SRE and platform work, and I never went back.
		</p>

		<p>
			Outside of work, I play piano, play chess, write songs, and dabble in animation. I'm
			also currently pursuing a Bachelor's in Business Administration (Entrepreneurship);
			reliability work and entrepreneurship scratch different itches, and I like having both.
		</p>

		<p>I'm married to Hannah Idimmachukwu.</p>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	main p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}
</style>
